$MDESC::Type = "GoldenEye007";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other inside the basement of a St. Petersburg library. " @
         "\n\n<f1>OHMSS Briefing: " @
         "\n\n<f0>Honestly James sometimes I think you damage your equipment on purpose. " @
         "\n\n<f0>I hope you can defend your performance because there isnt a lawyer in the land whod take on the case." @
         "\n\n<f2>There are no women or casinos for a thousand miles 007 so even you will be able to concentrate on this mission.";